  "summary": "Overall I have 39 years of experience in the Visual Communications industry. With my very diverse experience with ( Angular, Print Design, DVD Authoring / Mastering, Video Production, Mobile Applications & Web Design / Development ), I strongly believe that I could make a significant and valuable contribution in any firm to make things happen. I have a solid understanding of scalable design principles. I use a lightweight development process (Scrum), Jira for issues, Confluence for docs, and git for code.\n\nMy present skills are more of a mix. They are comprised of Angular, UX / UI Designer / Front End Web / Full Stack Developer. I have the experience /ability to design plus translate ALL wireframes/PSDs into launch-ready, valid, pixel perfect, responsive HTML/CSS/JS solutions. I am experienced with shepherding a project from the mere conceptual elements to the live active stage. \n\nSKILLS: \n\n* Html4\n* Xhtml\n* Dhtml\n* Html5\n* HTML5 Boilerplate\n* Twitter Bootstrap \n* Foundation\n* Dreamweaver\n* Responsive Design\n* SimpLESS\n* JavaScript\n* OO JavaScript\n* Jquery\n\n* Jquery\n* Jquery mobile\n* Json \n* GSAP\n* Velocity\n* Css3\n* Oocss \n* Smacss\n* Ajax\n* Mustache.js\n* Handelbars.js\n* CoffeeScript.js\n* Docker\n\n* MVC / MVP\n* Mongo DB\n* NPM\n* Node.js\n* React.js\n* Angular.js \n* Script aculo us \n* Modernizer.js \n* Motools.js \n* Prototype.js\n* Yoemen.js\n* Bower.js\n* Webpack.js\n* Kendo UI\n* Reqiure.js\n* Gulp.js\n* Grunt.js\n* Karma.js\n* Jasmine.js\n*  Less / Sass\n* Stylus\n* Git / GitFlow\n* Heroku / AWS\n* Svn\n* Jira\n* Confluence\n\n* Optimizely\n* PHP \n* Php MyAdmin\n* MySQL / \n* NoSQL\n* Smarty\n* Symfony \n* Zend Framework 2\n* CodeIgniter\n* Kintera Blackbaud\n* Keynote\n* Omnigraffle\n* Balsamiq\n\n* Proto.io  \n* Invision\n* iRise\n* Joomla\n* WordPress\n* Drupal\n* 360 Grid System\n* Flash\n* Adobe Creative Suite\n* Wufoo\n* DVD Studio Pro\n* Final Cut\n* Quark Xpress 12.0",
