    "description": "* Lead all web projects from the creative scope with client, conceptual design stage and then to a successful live implementation\n* Experience with open source development tools / frameworks like Angular, React, MongoDB, NPM, Bower, Webpack and Grunt\n* Worked closely with multi-disciplined creative team to help develop new website features and build upon established visual styles\n* Managed projects ensuring that all deliverables are developed, cleanly, compliant, semantic and deployed on time within budget\n* Take part in the decision-making around major architectural decisions of the front-end team and established effective processes.\n* Leading / Collaborating and Supervision of both freelance staff designers and multi experienced developers on diverse projects\n* Translated PSD comps / Wire-frames into scalable, responsive, annotated, well thought out HTML templates / web applications\n* Extensive experience hand-coding responsive, html5, css3, javaScript, json, php, boostrap, jQuery & Full Stack CMS solutions\n* Daily use of command line / shell scripting with various build tools, repositories, unit testing platforms, QA tool & deployment tools \n* Understand business objectives and subsequently translating that business logic into solution base technical design / applications\n* Understanding of Test Driven Development (TDD), Behavior Driven Development (BDD), Data Driven Development (DDD)\n* Learning, stay plugged into newer emerging technologies / industry trends and apply them into daily operations and activities\n* Conceptualizing results driven solutions for new multimedia, web / mobile apps and campaign related print collateral projects    \n* Source control, Git configuration management, and managed individual project priorities, deadlines and deliverables.\n* Balanced the end user needs with clients present business objectives and improving overall end user experience \n\n\n",
